        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "Selected scope is exactly inequality(1.5) for nonempty smooth compact connected minimal boundary. M is a smooth connected complete noncompact one-ended Riemannian3-manifold, 1<p<3, strongly p-nonparabolic, scalar curvature nonnegative, relative H2(M,boundaryM;Z)=0 and the exact displayed condition(dagger) on the level-gradient integral. All new Lemmas3.1–3.2 and AppendixA monotonicity/regularization proofs are included. Existing p-harmonic regularity, the published regularized differential inequality and the standard generalized l-Hospital criterion are background; the author supplies the new critical-set/distribution convergence and mass comparison. The boundary-free positivity and Euclidean rigidity portions are excluded: their source uses Gp once and log Gp subsequently and finishes rigidity by a prior calculation. No source change or new boundary-free proof is supplied."
